<title>HONG KONG: HK land auction - police station site gets HK$760mln.</title>
<headline>HK land auction - police station site gets HK$760mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 1,223-square-metre Causeway Bay Police Station site in the North Point district sold for HK$760 million at a Hong Kong government land auction on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The price compared with analysts' expectation of between HK$691 million and HK$720 million. The plot is slated for conversion into a commercial site.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
